1
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:08,000
[gasps]

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,000
[footsteps echoing]

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Just stay back.

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Don't come any closer.

5
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Pouf, please.

6
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:20,000
[dramatic music playing]

7
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:22,000
[scoffs]

8
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,000
[opening theme music playing]

9
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:32,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

10
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:03,000
[singer singing in English]

11
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:05,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

12
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:26,000
[singer singing in English]

13
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:30,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

14
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:57,000
May I ask why?

15
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:00,000
If only you had kept quiet,

16
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:02,000
I would have been able
to kill him quite easily.

17
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:07,000
Where is all this
irrational fear coming from?

18
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:09,000
[Neferpitou] He noticed you.

19
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:11,000
If you had closed in with blood lust,

20
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:13,000
he would have attacked Komugi.

21
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:15,000
That much, I'm absolutely sure.

22
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:19,000
That risk was one I just couldn't take.

23
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:33,000
but why would he do that?

24
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:36,000
[Gon] This is none of your business.

25
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:38,000
You just shut up.

26
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:51,000
You go see how Knuckle's doing.

27
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:53,000
Pouf has moved outside the barrier now,

28
00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:00,000
whether to fight or retreat.

29
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:02,000
[Meleoron] Wait. What about you guys?

30
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:06,000
[Killua] Once Gon gets like this,
he's not gonna budge for anything.

31
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:09,000
I might go down with him.

32
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:10,000
[sighs]

33
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:11,000
[Killua] I'm kidding!

34
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:13,000
Look, we're okay.

35
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:17,000
I've got the magic word "Kite"
as backup. Don't worry.

36
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:18,000
So just leave it to me.

37
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:20,000
[Meleoron] Are you sure?

38
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:24,000
But, if that's the case, then why…

39
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:29,000
why did you look so sad back there?

40
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:36,000
You're positive, right?

41
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:38,000
Can't you tell me?

42
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:40,000
Don't you want to?

43
00:03:58,000 --> 00:04:00,000
[intense music playing]

44
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:12,000
[wind blowing]

45
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:17,000
[Shaiapouf] Ah, I'm downwind.

46
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:26,000
Farewell.

47
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:28,000
[Gon] Don't move.

48
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:30,000
Stay right there.

49
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:34,000
You use your butterfly wing scales
to control people, right?

50
00:04:34,000 --> 00:04:35,000
Don't move a step.

51
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:38,000
[dramatic music playing]

52
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:42,000
Pouf, please stay.

53
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:44,000
[Shaiapouf] Are you insane?

54
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:47,000
You want me to stay and do nothing at all,

55
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:50,000
just for the sake of that girl?

56
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:52,000
It's for the King.

57
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:56,000
Please do as he says.

58
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:02,000
[Shaiapouf] What happened here?

59
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:07,000
Your attitude is completely different
than it was before.

60
00:05:09,000 --> 00:05:12,000
Something happened
while I was imprisoned.

61
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:23,000
I give you my word

62
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:32,000
is that you just fill me in
on all that's happened.

63
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:38,000
If I ask where the King is,

64
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:41,000
he'll become suspicious and silence us.

65
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:45,000
Give me a hint, something subtle.

66
00:05:47,000 --> 00:05:50,000
And of course,
try to make it sound natural.

67
00:05:50,000 --> 00:05:55,000
If you fail, it will be
nothing less than a bloodbath.

68
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:57,000
That's all there is to it.

69
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:00,000
[gasps]

70
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:09,000
[A.P.R.] It is time.
You've accrued interest.

71
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:13,000
[intense music playing]

72
00:06:24,000 --> 00:06:28,000
If I do it one more time,
I'll have it mastered for sure.

73
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:31,000
I need rage.

74
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:55,000
Calmly release my fury,

75
00:06:55,000 --> 00:06:58,000
destruction and creation together…

76
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:09,000
comprehend the existence
of reciprocal emotions.

77
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:13,000
And now, in his present state…

78
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:18,000
[Menthuthuyoupi] Rage like this

79
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:21,000
should never be allowed to flow freely.

80
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:24,000
It's meant to be directed, to be used!

81
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:44,000
[laughs] Another fake?

82
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:47,000
Well, okay! That's fine with me!

83
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:51,000
More! More! Fuel my rage!

84
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:06,000
It is time. You've accrued interest.

85
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:13,000
assuming that aura consumption

86
00:08:13,000 --> 00:08:16,000
would continue to rise
at the current rate.

87
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:19,000
Even if Youpi were to reduce
his aura usage

88
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:23,000
to a bare minimum, in another
three minutes and fifty seconds,

89
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:26,000
he would lose his Nen abilities.

90
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:30,000
[Morel panting]

91
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:34,000
[Morel] Ten left.

92
00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:37,000
[gasps]

93
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:42,000
It's the 11th hour.

94
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:47,000
I get the feeling that
he's saving me for last.

95
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:50,000
If that's the case,

96
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:53,000
then I'll keep fighting
for as long as I can.

97
00:08:56,000 --> 00:08:58,000
[narrator] Morel had deployed
all of his puppets

98
00:08:58,000 --> 00:09:01,000
within Youpi's sight
in order to keep better track of him,

99
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:04,000
but there was another reason
for this strategy.

100
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:06,000
His energy was beginning to wane.

101
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:08,000
He was so worn out, in fact,

102
00:09:08,000 --> 00:09:13,000
that dispersing them over a wider area
had become completely impossible.

103
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:16,000
If he lost his focus,

104
00:09:16,000 --> 00:09:19,000
the puppets would turn
to smoke and vanish.

105
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:22,000
[Morel] It shouldn't be much longer.

106
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:27,000
He has to run out of Nen
at some point, but…

107
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:30,000
no matter how hard I try,

108
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:34,000
my body and soul refuse to move.
Damn it.

109
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:39,000
[narrator] As he summoned
every last ounce of willpower,

110
00:09:39,000 --> 00:09:43,000
Morel knew his body would
eventually cease to respond.

111
00:09:43,000 --> 00:09:47,000
Unfortunately, this came sooner
than Youpi's bankruptcy.

112
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:48,000
[panting]

113
00:10:02,000 --> 00:10:05,000
[Menthuthuyoupi] I've got something
I wanna say to you.

114
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:17,000
[chuckles]

115
00:10:18,000 --> 00:10:20,000
You look like a half-dead fly.

116
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:23,000
Even so…

117
00:10:24,000 --> 00:10:26,000
you guys are amazing.

118
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:27,000
[dramatic music playing]

119
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:31,000
[narrator] He had shown
astonishing growth during combat,

120
00:10:31,000 --> 00:10:33,000
far beyond Morel and the others,

121
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:35,000
but when he spoke,

122
00:10:35,000 --> 00:10:38,000
it was not to taunt
or gloat over his opponent.

123
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:41,000
Instead, his words
were of pure admiration.

124
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:50,000
he expected to hear in this situation,

125
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:54,000
but Youpi's feelings
were heartfelt and sincere,

126
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:58,000
a fact that Morel
had no choice but to accept.

127
00:10:59,000 --> 00:11:02,000
[Menthuthuyoupi] I'm not
really sure how to say this,

128
00:11:02,000 --> 00:11:05,000
but because you were so incredible,

129
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:07,000
I should kill you now.

130
00:11:07,000 --> 00:11:09,000
It's only proper.

131
00:11:27,000 --> 00:11:29,000
Farewell.

132
00:11:36,000 --> 00:11:39,000
[wind blowing]

133
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:41,000
[groans]

134
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:54,000
Blood.

135
00:11:54,000 --> 00:11:57,000
What's going on? Did he teleport?

136
00:11:58,000 --> 00:11:59,000
[intense music playing]

137
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:02,000
[Menthuthuyoupi] I was just about
to cut through him

138
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:10,000
I figured one of them
had the ability to use teleportation,

139
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:14,000
but when he vanished,
I didn't see anyone else around.

140
00:12:17,000 --> 00:12:21,000
so if he did teleport,
I wouldn't have drawn any blood.

141
00:12:22,000 --> 00:12:25,000
If I could cut him, why can't I see him?

142
00:12:26,000 --> 00:12:29,000
Does that mean he's invisible?
Is that his ability?

143
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:37,000
Which means that one of the others

144
00:12:37,000 --> 00:12:42,000
must be able to make himself invisible,
along with the rest of them.

145
00:12:42,000 --> 00:12:45,000
And right before I stabbed
the guy with the sunglasses,

146
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:53,000
Well, I left a deep wound.

147
00:12:55,000 --> 00:12:58,000
[suspenseful music playing]

148
00:13:08,000 --> 00:13:11,000
The blood. Youpi can see the blood.

149
00:13:12,000 --> 00:13:15,000
We may be invisible,
but we're leaving a trail.

150
00:13:21,000 --> 00:13:24,000
[gasps] I can't hold my breath any longer.

151
00:13:31,000 --> 00:13:34,000
[muffled grunting]

152
00:13:38,000 --> 00:13:40,000
Knuckle?

153
00:13:41,000 --> 00:13:43,000
Why did you show yourself?

154
00:13:44,000 --> 00:13:47,000
The plan was for you to stay hidden
as long as possible.

155
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:56,000
I'm all done running away and hiding.

156
00:13:56,000 --> 00:13:58,000
I'll take you on.

157
00:13:58,000 --> 00:14:00,000
[wind blowing]

158
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:01,000
So…

159
00:14:03,000 --> 00:14:05,000
please show them mercy, all right?

160
00:14:06,000 --> 00:14:08,000
[suspenseful music playing]

161
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:10,000
[narrator] Knuckle took a chance

162
00:14:10,000 --> 00:14:13,000
on using diplomacy instead of violence.

163
00:14:13,000 --> 00:14:18,000
He had heard Youpi's words earlier
and was deeply moved by them.

164
00:14:20,000 --> 00:14:22,000
[chuckles]

165
00:14:22,000 --> 00:14:23,000
You're out of your mind.

166
00:14:24,000 --> 00:14:27,000
That's not even close to a fair trade.

167
00:14:27,000 --> 00:14:28,000
[gasps]

168
00:14:29,000 --> 00:14:31,000
[Menthuthuyoupi] My answer…

169
00:14:33,000 --> 00:14:34,000
is no.

170
00:14:34,000 --> 00:14:35,000
[gasps]

171
00:14:37,000 --> 00:14:38,000
But…

172
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:54,000
Now those would be terms
I could agree to.

173
00:14:54,000 --> 00:14:56,000
[grunting]

174
00:14:58,000 --> 00:15:01,000
[Morel] No. Don't do it.

175
00:15:01,000 --> 00:15:04,000
Just think. Don't be a fool, Knuckle!

176
00:15:05,000 --> 00:15:08,000
[narrator] Due to the effects
of God's Accomplice,

177
00:15:21,000 --> 00:15:22,000
[gasps]

178
00:15:30,000 --> 00:15:31,000
[Meleoron] Don't do it.

179
00:15:31,000 --> 00:15:34,000
Please, Knuckle, anything but that.

180
00:15:34,000 --> 00:15:37,000
[Morel] Don't worry… about me.

181
00:15:38,000 --> 00:15:41,000
[Meleoron] This battle
will have been for nothing!

182
00:15:41,000 --> 00:15:43,000
[Morel] All we've done till now…

183
00:15:43,000 --> 00:15:45,000
[Meleoron] Think about
everything you've done,

184
00:15:45,000 --> 00:15:49,000
and Morel and Shoot.
You've all risked your lives!

185
00:15:53,000 --> 00:15:55,000
[narrator] If Knuckle
were to stop himself,

186
00:16:02,000 --> 00:16:06,000
That was what Meleoron thought
when he let go of Morel.

187
00:16:06,000 --> 00:16:08,000
Knuckle.

188
00:16:08,000 --> 00:16:09,000
[Meleoron] Knuckle!

189
00:16:13,000 --> 00:16:15,000
[grunts]

190
00:16:16,000 --> 00:16:18,000
[narrator] But his plan backfired.

191
00:16:20,000 --> 00:16:21,000
How stupid.

192
00:16:22,000 --> 00:16:25,000
That's it. It's over.

193
00:16:25,000 --> 00:16:28,000
There's no way
we can beat Youpi anymore.

194
00:16:29,000 --> 00:16:32,000
Why? Damn it.

195
00:16:32,000 --> 00:16:34,000
[narrator] Seeing Morel
covered in blood,

196
00:16:34,000 --> 00:16:37,000
images of Shoot flashed
before Knuckle's eyes,

197
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:44,000
There. It's done.

198
00:16:44,000 --> 00:16:46,000
A.P.R. is deactivated.

199
00:16:46,000 --> 00:16:50,000
Now the terms are even,
so leave the boss alone.

200
00:17:05,000 --> 00:17:06,000
Nah, screw all that.

201
00:17:07,000 --> 00:17:09,000
[gasps] Wait a minute!

202
00:17:09,000 --> 00:17:11,000
Where the hell are you going?

203
00:17:11,000 --> 00:17:13,000
[Menthuthuyoupi] To the King, of course.

204
00:17:13,000 --> 00:17:15,000
I thought that was obvious.

205
00:17:16,000 --> 00:17:18,000
You want to come along with me?

206
00:17:18,000 --> 00:17:20,000
You'd die, you dummy.

207
00:17:26,000 --> 00:17:28,000
[Menthuthuyoupi]
Then you'd better rush

208
00:17:28,000 --> 00:17:30,000
the guy in sunglasses
to a doctor, quick,

209
00:17:30,000 --> 00:17:33,000
or you just made that trade for nothing.

210
00:17:34,000 --> 00:17:37,000
[dramatic music playing]

211
00:17:43,000 --> 00:17:45,000
[Menthuthuyoupi scoffs]

212
00:17:56,000 --> 00:18:02,000
In a way, this irritation felt different
than his usual rage.

213
00:18:03,000 --> 00:18:05,000
[Menthuthuyoupi] Try me anytime.

214
00:18:05,000 --> 00:18:07,000
We'll fight as equals then.

215
00:18:09,000 --> 00:18:11,000
I don't need to kill you right now.

216
00:18:12,000 --> 00:18:13,000
That's all.

217
00:18:15,000 --> 00:18:18,000
Damn it. I sound like Pouf.

218
00:18:20,000 --> 00:18:22,000
[narrator] During combat,
Youpi had learned

219
00:18:22,000 --> 00:18:24,000
how profound Nen really was.

220
00:18:24,000 --> 00:18:28,000
It had also awakened
his previously meager sense of self.

221
00:18:29,000 --> 00:18:32,000
Once he'd learned
to compartmentalize his rage,

222
00:18:36,000 --> 00:18:38,000
His perception grew.

223
00:18:44,000 --> 00:18:47,000
[Menthuthuyoupi] They're responsible
for the rage I've stored,

224
00:18:47,000 --> 00:18:49,000
so why don't
I feel like using it on them?

225
00:18:49,000 --> 00:18:51,000
I don't understand it.

226
00:18:53,000 --> 00:18:56,000
Now that I have it, I have to use it,

227
00:19:15,000 --> 00:19:19,000
[Knuckle] I lost… completely.

228
00:19:21,000 --> 00:19:22,000
Knuckle!

229
00:19:22,000 --> 00:19:23,000
[Knuckle gasps]

230
00:19:24,000 --> 00:19:26,000
[Meleoron] We gotta help him!

231
00:19:29,000 --> 00:19:31,000
Come on, boss. Let's go.

232
00:19:39,000 --> 00:19:40,000
So go.

233
00:19:42,000 --> 00:19:46,000
You can still fight, the two of you.

234
00:19:47,000 --> 00:19:49,000
Do what you can.

235
00:19:50,000 --> 00:19:54,000
He said to try him anytime,

236
00:19:54,000 --> 00:19:56,000
so go now.

237
00:19:59,000 --> 00:20:01,000
[Knuckle] I can't.

238
00:20:02,000 --> 00:20:05,000
'Cause I…

239
00:20:12,000 --> 00:20:14,000
Knuckle.

240
00:20:21,000 --> 00:20:23,000
[moans]

241
00:20:23,000 --> 00:20:26,000
So why would we keep doing this?

242
00:20:27,000 --> 00:20:28,000
I can't think of a reason.

243
00:20:29,000 --> 00:20:31,000
[Knov] The King.

244
00:20:44,000 --> 00:20:45,000
[shivering]

245
00:20:45,000 --> 00:20:47,000
I'll take care of Morel.

246
00:20:47,000 --> 00:20:49,000
Shoot is also safe.

247
00:20:52,000 --> 00:20:53,000
Do you want to come with me, too?

248
00:20:53,000 --> 00:20:57,000
[Morel] Wait.
Let me hit this little brat hard.

249
00:20:57,000 --> 00:21:00,000
[Knov] I just got word
from the Chairman's messenger.

250
00:21:01,000 --> 00:21:02,000
[shuddering]

251
00:21:02,000 --> 00:21:05,000
He was able to take the King
to the agreed-upon spot.

252
00:21:05,000 --> 00:21:06,000
[all gasp]

253
00:21:07,000 --> 00:21:08,000
[Knov] Even if they leave now,

254
00:21:08,000 --> 00:21:11,000
the Royal Guard won't make it in time,

255
00:21:11,000 --> 00:21:13,000
so consider them fired.

256
00:21:13,000 --> 00:21:16,000
Same goes for you guys. [laughs]

257
00:21:17,000 --> 00:21:18,000
Where's Palm?

258
00:21:18,000 --> 00:21:19,000
[Knuckle] No word yet.

259
00:21:19,000 --> 00:21:21,000
[Knov] I see.

260
00:21:21,000 --> 00:21:24,000
Well, now what?

261
00:21:38,000 --> 00:21:39,000
[Knov] I see.

262
00:21:44,000 --> 00:21:45,000
You're tough.

263
00:21:51,000 --> 00:21:53,000
[Knuckle] Let's go.

264
00:21:53,000 --> 00:21:55,000
[Meleoron] To look for Palm?

265
00:21:55,000 --> 00:21:57,000
[Knuckle] No. We can do that later.

266
00:21:58,000 --> 00:22:00,000
There's something else
we have to do first.

267
00:22:04,000 --> 00:22:07,000
Youpi's not the only Royal Guard,
you know.

268
00:22:07,000 --> 00:22:08,000
[closing theme music playing]

269
00:22:09,000 --> 00:22:12,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

270
00:23:27,000 --> 00:23:30,000
[upbeat music playing]

271
00:23:30,000 --> 00:23:32,000
[Gon] Next time, "Pose and Name."

272
00:23:32,000 --> 00:23:34,000
Hey, Killua, say my name.

273
00:23:38,000 --> 00:23:40,000
-[Killua] Gon.
-[Gon] Killua.

274
00:23:40,000 --> 00:23:41,000
[Gon and Killua laugh]

275
00:23:42,000 --> 00:23:44,000
[singer singing in Japanese]
